# Collected data. Raw payloads and processed tables are regenerated by
# running the pipeline; committing them would bloat the repo and, in the
# case of raw YouTube payloads, embed request metadata unnecessarily.
# Small trimmed samples live in tests/fixtures/ and ARE committed, so that
# the test suite runs without a network connection or an API key.
data/
